<tr id="S7.T2.5.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S7.T2.5.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Cobra <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Francia, 2013</a>)</cite></td>
