<figure id="S7.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3. </span>Comparison of line coverage and valid rate across all baselines. Our approach, <span id="S7.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LspRag</span>, consistently outperforms all baselines, achieving higher scores across diverse projects and models. Missing values (–) indicate that the baseline does not support test generation for those projects.</figcaption>
<div id="S7.T3.8" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:145.5pt;vertical-align:-71.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-116.7pt,49.2pt) scale(0.596514784741166,0.596514784741166) ;">
<table id="S7.T3.8.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S7.T3.8.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
